# The textures City State Phobos and Castle Velscour still want, asked of ChatGPT's image tool in batches of twenty
# (tools/phobos/texture_requests/build_zips.py packs them). Each: what it is, where it goes, how big a piece of the world
# the picture covers, its palette, the current game tile it must sit beside (ref, assets/game/phobos/tex), and its kind:
#   tile   seamless both ways (walls, floors, roofs, cloth)
#   strip  a band, seamless left-right only (copings, cornices, friezes, ridges)
#   single one object filling the frame (a door, a banner, a window)
#   mask   seamless greyscale, white = the effect (soot, damp, cracks): laid over walls in world space
#   decal  one shape on pure black, white = the effect (a splash, a scorch)
# aspect: square 1024x1024, wide 1536x1024, tall 1024x1536.

